<section id="about">
    <div class="wrap about">
        <div class="label-col">
            <div class="label">// the human</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-col">
            <p>
                I'm Raghav - a builder who'd rather understand one problem
                deeply than fake breadth across ten. I build the work and the
                products I actually believe in, and I treat learning a new field
                as the fun part, not the overhead.
            </p>
            <p>
                Most days start with a run before the world's awake - the
                discipline there is the same one I bring to a build. Off the
                clock I'm an unrepentant anime nerd and the owner of a flute I
                keep promising to practise. I build the way I'd want someone to
                build for me: carefully, honestly, and finished.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        padding: 110px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .about {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: start;
    }

    .label {
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }

    .text-col p {
        font-family: var(--serif);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.3vw, 1.7rem);
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    .text-col p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .about {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }
    }
</style>
